+# 2026-11-01
+
+## Done
+
+- Added `GET /api/operations/recent`, restricted to admins, returning operations from the last 30 days.
+- New pieces: `OperationService`, `ClockConfiguration`, a date-range query in `OperationRepository`, a URL matcher in `SecurityConfiguration`.
+- Tests added: two cases in `OperationResourceIT` (admin sees recent only, non-admin gets 403) and `OperationServiceTest` for the window bounds.
+- Build and tests were not run on request; the changes are verified by reading only.
+
+## Next
+
+- Run `./mvnw verify` (or at least the `OperationResourceIT` and `TechnicalStructureTest` classes) to confirm the changes compile and pass.
+- Decide whether `docs/api.md` should list `/api/operations/recent` as an admin exception to the `/api/admin` convention.
+
+See [[2026-11-01-recent-operations-endpoint]] and [[index]].
